Material Icons — https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
License: Apache License 2.0
The TV and HDMI (streaming stick) device icons use the path data of the
"tv" and "settings_input_hdmi" icons, the Debloat button that of
"cleaning_services", the off-Wi-Fi screen that of "wifi_off", and the
Apps, Files and Tweaks tabs those of "apps", "folder" and "tune", the
Upload files button that of "upload", the empty Movies folder that of
"movie", the links in Settings that of "open_in_new", and the Remote's
restart, waiting, can't-reach and dock menu icons those of "restart_alt",
"hourglass_top", "link_off", "swap_horiz" and "remove_circle_outline".
